sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Browser
  participant A as API
  participant R as Redis queue
  participant W as Worker
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>A: POST /documents (many files)
  A->>A: stream to disk, check type and size, sha256
  A->>D: insert document (queued)
  A->>R: enqueue job
  A-->>U: 202 Accepted + ids
  R->>W: job
  W->>D: claim row (FOR UPDATE), status processing
  loop while processing
    U->>A: GET /documents/id/status
    A-->>U: stage and progress
  end
  W->>W: parse / OCR, extract, validate
  W->>D: save pages, invoices, issues, chunks
  W->>D: status completed or needs_review
  U->>A: GET /documents/id/result
  U->>A: PATCH /invoices/id (correction)
  A->>D: audit trail, re-validate, refresh status
